# Trusted vakr release signing keys, in ssh-keygen "allowed signers" format
# (see ssh-keygen(1), ALLOWED SIGNERS). The package installs this file as
# /opt/vakr/share/release-signers, and `vakr self-update` checks
# SHA256SUMS.sig against it before installing anything (UPD-001, ADR-026).
#
# PLACEHOLDER: no key is listed yet, so every signature check fails closed.
# The project owner adds the release public key, one line per key:
#
#   vakr-release namespaces="vakr-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...key... vakr release
#
# Both the principal and the namespace are "vakr-release". To rotate, add the
# new key here and publish that release signed with the old key; remove the
# old key in a later release.
